 Package: openssl
 Version: 1:4.0.POST.CLANG.FORMAT.WEBKIT.2092.g2bbbeef743-20260825.135850530605843
 Architecture: amd64
 Maintainer: Debian OpenSSL Team <pkg-openssl-devel@alioth-lists.debian.net>
